<p dir="ltr">Here are a few things you could build next:</p>
<ul dir="ltr">
<li><strong>Payments:</strong> M-Pesa or card payment for accepted offers, so a task can be paid and completed on the platform. This needs a server-side step, so we would plan it carefully.</li>
<li><strong>Reviews and ratings:</strong> let customers rate providers after a task is complete, and show the rating on offers.</li>
<li><strong>Profiles:</strong> a photo, a short bio and skills for each member, which would fill the avatar circles on task cards.</li>
<li><strong>Categories with icons:</strong> a row of category icons above the task list, like Airtaskerâ€™s home screen.</li>
<li><strong>Email or SMS alerts:</strong> notify users about new offers and messages outside the site.</li>
<li><strong>Task status flow:</strong> Open, Assigned, Completed, with buttons for the customer and provider.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="ltr">If you want any of these, or any other fix, send me the screenshots as before and a short list of what to change. I can do several in one update.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="ms-[calc(var(--cds-assistant-message-text-inset,0px)_-_6px)] touch:has-[&gt;[data-size=xs]&gt;:first-child:not(time)]:ms-[calc(var(--cds-assistant-message-text-inset,0px)_-_0.625rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] print:mt-xs"><div data-cds="MessageActions" data-reveal="fade" role="toolbar" aria-label="Message actions" data-size="xs" tabindex="-1" class="flex items-center select-none touch:flex-wrap touch:[--cds-h-control--xs:calc(2rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] touch:h-auto touch:min-h-[calc(1.5rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] touch:gap-y-[calc(0.5rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] touch:*:-my-[calc(0.25rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] [&amp;_button]:text-muted [&amp;_button:hover:not([aria-pressed=true])]:text-primary stacks:[&amp;_button:not(:where([data-cds-theme],[data-cds-theme]_*))]:[--cds-text-muted:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-plain-secondary)]!" data-testid="message-actions"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 rounded-[calc(var(--cds-radius)+var(--cds-button-radius-add,0px))] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;: